"collabRules":{"x":3130,"y":5240,"w":420,"text":"Collaboration rules\n\n1. No one under 18 may appear in any content, adult or not.\n2. Every person shown in a post must pass ID + selfie checks before it can publish.\n3. Each co-performer gives consent per post, after seeing it.\n4. Revenue splits are paid from the ledger automatically.\n5. A co-performer can withdraw consent: the post stops selling at once and goes to review.","size":"m","fill":"orange"},
"fan":{"x":0,"y":6300,"text":"Fan PWA","kind":"title1","maxW":9430},
"marketing":{"x":0,"y":7820,"text":"Marketing site & auth pages","kind":"title1","maxW":4480},
"authNotes":{"x":4560,"y":8100,"w":440,"text":"Auth carousel behaviour\n\n1. 5 slides, one image each (see the image prompts), headline + one line over a dark gradient on the left.\n2. Auto-advance every 6 s, pause on hover and focus, no auto-play when the user prefers reduced motion.\n3. Dots are real buttons with labels: Slide 1 of 5.\n4. Below 1024 px the carousel collapses to a 200 px banner above the form showing one slide.\n5. Images are decorative: alt=\"\" with the headline as real text.","size":"m","fill":"orange"}
},
